      {
        "Id": "1129d06e65ba4218829a752f32969c58",
        "Title": "A SubSet is a smaller collection of Sheets within the Sheet Set. SubSets can have their own properties for how a Sheet is created.\r\n\r\nThis group demonstrates creating a new SubSet using the Sheet Set defaults.\r\n\r\nTo assign new values to the SubSet upon creation, provide the appropriate values to the SubSet.CreateNewSubset input ports.",
